\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 43\u12289?A\u-242?\u20445?\u25345?\u19981?\u21464? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u20943?1 \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u21152?1 \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u32622?\u-26890?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 44\u12289?A\u-242?\u26080?\u19978?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\u-244?\u20063?\u26080?\u19979?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u26377?\u19978?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\u-244?\u20294?\u26080?\u19979?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u26377?\u19979?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\u-244?\u20294?\u26080?\u19978?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u26377?\u19978?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\u-244?\u20063?\u26377?\u19979?\u-28485?\u31354?\u-27150?\u21306?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 45\u12289?\u30005?\u24433?\u25918?\u26144?\u30340?\u26631?\u20934?\u26159?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(56) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 \u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160?A\u-242?24\u24103?/\u31186? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?48\u24103?/\u31186? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?60\u24103?/\u31186? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?120\u24103?/\u31186?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 46\u12289?\u24066?\u22330?\u19978?\u20986?\u21806?\u26631?\u26377?80 min/700 MB \u160?CD-R\u20809?\u30424?\u-244?80 min \u160?700 MB\u-28419?\u26159?\u25351?\u23427?\u30340?\u23481?\u-28209?\u12290?\u20854?\u20013?\u-244?700 MB\u26159?\u25351?\u-29776?\u24405?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(38) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 (1MB=1024\u215?1024B\u-244?\u22235?\u-32243?\u20116?\u20837?\u21462?\u25972?\u25968?)\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?80\u20998?\u-27489?CD-DA\u22768?\u-26637? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?CD-ROM Mode 1\u30340?\u29992?\u25143?\u25968?\u25454?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?CD-ROM Mode 2\u30340?\u29992?\u25143?\u25968?\u25454? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u20854?\u20182?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 47\u12289?\u25289?\u26031?\u32500?\u21152?\u26031?(Las Vegas)\u31639?\u27861?\u26159?\u19968?\u31181?\u24120?\u29992?\u30340?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(60) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 \u31639?\u27861?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u27010?\u29575? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u-28719?\u20284? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u30830?\u23450?\u24615? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u20998?\u25903?\u8212?\u-27056?\u30028?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?Object-oriented analysis (OOA. is a semiformal specification technique for the object-oriented paradigm. Object-oriented analysis consists of three steps. The first step is \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?48 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  . It determines how the various results are computed by the product and presents this information in the form of a \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?49 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  and associated scenarios. The second is \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?50 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  , which determines the classes and their attributes, then determines the interrelationships and interaction among the classes. The last step is \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?51 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  , which determines the actions performed by or to each class or subclass and presents this information in the form of \f1\fs24\ul  \u160?52 \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24  .\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 48\u12289? A. static modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. dynamic modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. use-case modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. behavioral modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 49\u12289? A. component diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?B. sequence diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. interactive Diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. use-case diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 50\u12289? A. use-case modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. class modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. dynamic modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. behavioral modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 51\u12289? A. static modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?B. use-case modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. dynamic modeling \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. class modeling\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 52\u12289? A. state diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. collaboration diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C. sequence diagram \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. activity diagram\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 53\u12289?10000\u24352?\u20998?\u-28760?\u29575?\u20026?1024\u215?768\u30340?\u30495?\u24425?(32\u20301?)\u22270?\u29255?\u21051?\u24405?\u21040?DVD\u20809?\u30424?\u19978?\u-244?\u20551?\u-29762?\u27599?\u24352?\u20809?\u30424?\u21487?\u20197?\u23384?\u25918?4GB\u30340?\u20449?\u24687?\u-244?\u21017?\u-26880?\u-30335?______\u24352?\u20809?\u30424?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?7 \u160? \u160?B\u-242?8 \u160? \u160?C\u-242?70 \u160? \u160?D\u-242?71\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 54\u12289?\u31243?\u24207?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u23567?\u32452?\u30340?\u32452?\u32455?\u24418?\u24335?\u26377?\u24456?\u22810?\u31181?\u-244?\u20854?\u20013?\u20415?\u20110?\u-26938?\u20013?\u-26490?\u23548?\u12289?\u27493?\u-29693?\u32479?\u19968?\u30340?\u26159?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(14) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 \u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u21333?\u20154?\u23567?\u32452? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u20027?\u31243?\u24207?\u21592?\u32452? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u26080?\u20027?\u31243?\u24207?\u21592?\u32452? \u160?D\u-242?\u23618?\u27425?\u24335?\u31243?\u24207?\u21592?\u32452?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 55\u12289?H.264\u30340?\u-30266?\u20687?\u32534?\u30721?\u26159?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(36) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 \u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?